<v Ira Glass>That was kind of an ad-lib, that last part. Special thanks to our programs co-founder, Mr. Torey Malatia. You know, he gave this pep talk to the staff at our summer staff retreat-- not his most effective effort.
<v Ira Glass>那最后一部分是即兴发挥。特别感谢我们节目的联合创始人托里·马拉蒂亚（Torey Malatia）先生。你知道，他在我们的夏季员工静修会上给员工打气——那不是他最有效的努力。

00:57:11.190 --> 00:57:20.530
<v David Rakoff>Who will see their dreams fall away into the abyss and eventually succumb to the crashing sadness and meaninglessness of it all? We will!
<v David Rakoff>谁会眼睁睁看着自己的梦想坠入深渊，最终屈服于那种毁灭性的悲伤和毫无意义？我们会！

00:57:20.530 --> 00:57:24.820
<v Ira Glass>I'm Ira Glass. Back next week with more stories of This American Life.
<v Ira Glass>我是艾拉·格拉斯。下周带着更多《美国生活》的故事回来。

